flowchart TD
    U[Chat message] --> T[Part B Chat Trigger]
    T --> A[Gemini Travel Agent]
    M[Simple Memory keyed by sessionId] <--> A
    A --> C[MCP Client]
    C --> S[Part A MCP Server]
    S --> W[Open-Meteo weather]
    S --> P[Google Places search]
    S --> X[Exchange rate tool - disabled]
    S --> G[Save preference to Google Sheets]
    S --> R[Get preference from Google Sheets]
    W --> A
    P --> A
    G --> A
    R --> A
    A --> O[Travel itinerary response]
